# textdomain: doggiowars
# Slovenian translation of DoggioWars. English is the source language.

Aerial dogfight over floating voxel islands — you ARE the fighter plane. 12 island biomes, volcanoes and waterfalls, aerobatic tricks, destructible terrain and greyhound races after a golden rabbit. Keyboard + gamepad.=Zračni boj nad lebdečimi voksel otoki — TI SI lovsko letalo. 12 otoških biomov, vulkani in slapovi, akrobatske figure, uničljiv teren in dirke hrtov za zlatim zajcem. Tipkovnica + igralni plošček.
